flowchart LR
    B[Browser dashboard] --> API[FastAPI API]
    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    API --> Q[(Redis)]
    API --> FS[(Hash-addressed files)]
    Q --> W[Document worker]
    W --> FS
    W --> OCR[Local Tesseract OCR]
    W --> DB
    API --> OL[Optional Ollama]
    OL --> API
    SAM[SAM.gov API] --> SI[SAM ingester]
    SI --> DB
    SI --> FS
    DB --> NW[Notification worker]
    NW --> SMTP[Optional SMTP]
    API --> HR[Human review and compliance workflow]
